  "facts": [
    "Kappelberg Tunnel, located on Bundesstraße 14 near Stuttgart, was upgraded after the European Tunnel Assessment Programme flagged safety issues. The €12 million refurbishment addressed ventilation, lighting, and structural integrity, ensuring compliance with modern safety standards.",
    "In 2006, after the comprehensive overhaul, the Kappelberg Tunnel earned a \"very good\" safety rating from the European Tunnel Assessment Programme, placing it among Germany's top‑rated road tunnels.",
    "The Kappelberg Tunnel, a key segment of Bundesstraße 14, serves as a vital shortcut for commuters traveling between Stuttgart and the surrounding regions, reducing travel time by bypassing congested surface roads."
